{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, תַּקִּיף²","hw":"תַּקִּיף²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תַּקִּיף</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. strong, mighty</strong>;—fs. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּקִּיפָה</span>, of kingdom, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:40\" href=\"/Daniel.2.40\">Dn 2:40</a> (like iron), v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:42\" href=\"/Daniel.2.42\">42</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א—ָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7:7</a>, of beast; mpl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּקִּיפִין</span>, of kings <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:20\" href=\"/Ezra.4.20\">Ezr 4:20</a>, God’s wonders <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:33\" href=\"/Daniel.3.33\">Dn 3:33</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, תְּרֵין²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, תְּקֹף"}